-- Seed real-world ATM locations for Botswana, sourced from OpenStreetMap
-- (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright, data licensed under ODbL).
-- Fetched via Overpass API: amenity=atm and amenity=bank[atm=yes] nodes
-- within Botswana's admin boundary. 124 ATMs.

-- atms.currency_code defaults to 'BWP' via FK to currencies, but seed.sql
-- (which normally inserts it) only runs after all migrations - insert it
-- here too so this migration doesn't depend on run order.
on conflict (code) do nothing;

